le.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA\/viewform?usp=sf_link\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA\/viewform?usp=sf_link<\/span><\/a> <\/p><p>We’ll add you to the group in 2-3 days after we receive your form entry. <\/p>","content_page":"","open":false}},"item_GXqjR9":{"type":"item","settings":{"header":"What kind of sessions do you conduct in the community? ","text_size":"h5","content":"<p>We conduct the following types of sessions:  <\/p><ul><li>Storytelling Sessions (for 2-6 yrs kids)<\/li><li>Book Exploration Sessions (for 6-12 yrs kids)<\/li><li>Fun activities for all ages <\/li><li>Expert sessions for parents and children <\/li><\/ul>","content_page":"","open":false}},"item_qNqMdY":{"type":"item","settings":{"header":"Are all the sessions online? ","text_size":"h5","content":"<p>Yes, all the sessions are conducted online on Zoom. The Zoom links for the sessions are shared on the community WhatsApp groups. <\/p>","content_page":"","open":false}},"item_xVybfX":{"type":"item","settings":{"header":"How much do the community sessions cost? ","text_size":"h5","content":"<p>The neOwn community sessions are completely free of cost! (This does not include our skill-building workshops)<\/p>","content_page":"","open":false}}},"block_order":["item_rXi9LA","item_8Xdibq","item_7NHnTP","item_pMza79","item_JkQ96P","item_GXqjR9","item_qNqMdY","item_xVybfX"],"settings":{"container":"container","color_scheme":"","image_position":"left","column_gap":100,"heading":"FAQs","heading_size":"h3","subheading":"","description":"","header_alignment":"center","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"animations":"inherit","custom_class":""}}},"order":["main","slider_rn4wVA","image_with_text_2_MaEaL9","empty_space_HCY4ze","image_with_text_2_qiajVg","rich_text_anVfeD","rich_text_aPcDzD","image_with_text_2_TT6nfg","custom_liquid_j9Epgg","empty_space_KedCRp","